hangeling 2.5 now, so for example Approaches aren't thing anymore so it's at least partially obsolete now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-04T07:51:24-07:00","id":1087685,"title":"","content":"I just want to clarify that I'm not bashing Rose and Maghan's version, Goblin Queens, Hedge Ghosts, and Using Horror rules for hobgoblins is very cool for example, just that the changes will likely cause mechanical issues.<br /> <br /> Unless I've misunderstood something.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-04T14:25:38-07:00","id":1087915,"title":"","content":"Maybe before you start claiming things are &quot;reduced to rubble,&quot; you wait until the book's been released and you can make an informed judgment?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13-blackhatmatt","name":"blackhatmatt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"464"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-05T12:00:42-07:00","id":1088405,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"